Package: panpathAudit
Type: Package
Title: Audit Sequence Preservation in GFA Traversals
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Anestis", "Gkanogiannis",
    email = "ganoyan@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
  )
Description: Audits source FASTA sequences against named paths and
    coordinate-aware walks in GFA files. It reports exact recovery,
    divergence coordinates, digests, and optional base-level statistics.
    Graph topology is not validated.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.6.0)
Imports:
    methods,
    Rcpp,
    S4Vectors
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests:
    BiocCheck,
    BiocStyle,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
SystemRequirements: C++20, zlib
biocViews: Alignment, DataImport, GenomeAssembly, Genetics, Sequencing
URL: https://github.com/gkanogiannis/panpathAudit
BugReports: https://github.com/gkanogiannis/panpathAudit/issues
NeedsCompilation: yes
RoxygenNote: 8.1.0
Config/testthat/edition: 3
